Error [jet.DeepCheckLeavesItsBody]: `break` can't leave a deep check
  --> tests/ui/deep_check_break.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |             break
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: A deep check runs only where `--deep-checks` keeps it, so whether the function or loop goes on can't depend on it.
 Fix: Take the `break` out of the `#On(.Deep)` body.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0515
